{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16201350","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16201350","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1620135001:1":{"text":"教授，你别着急，我们一定能找到解决办法的！","source_cn":"教授，你别着急，我们一定能找到解决办法的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6034ADC087C2D5B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620135002:1":{"text":"不过，小石头很害怕你吗？为什么一看见你，它就要跑走呢？","source_cn":"不过，小石头很害怕你吗？为什么一看见你，它就要跑走呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0F290E541885072","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620135003:1":{"text":"跑走？不，小石头没有走，它就在这里。只不过，我们看不见它。","source_cn":"跑走？不，小石头没有走，它就在这里。只不过，我们看不见它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB16EC5028782D8B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620135004:1":{"text":"药剂没有用，更验证了我的猜测。小石头不是逃走而消失，而是<style=\"highlight\">灵体被吹散</style>，无法成形。","source_cn":"药剂没有用，更验证了我的猜测。小石头不是逃走而消失，而...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD85AE01846D4FE8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620135005:1":{"text":"灵体被吹散……？","source_cn":"灵体被吹散……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x766D704C85766204","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female